      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始（一）",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在已接入 PCConfig 的本机 AI 对话里照常说要做的事；遇到重大的事或资料锁着时，AI 会弹出密码中心的验证窗口，由我亲自完成。"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **先看为什么要确认**　AI 说明是哪件事需要验证：重大的事，还是资料锁着要先解锁；普通网络故障或程序报错不会变成“要验证”。",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
